<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #333;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
    }
    .logo {
      max-width: 200px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 12px 24px;
      background-color: #4CAF50;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 4px;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    .features {
      margin: 30px 0;
      padding: 20px;
      background-color: #f9f9f9;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }
    .feature-item {
      margin: 10px 0;
    }
    .footer {
      margin-top: 30px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #666;
      text-align: center;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="header">
    <img src="{{logoUrl}}" alt="SyntaxisAI Logo" class="logo">
    <h1>Welcome to SyntaxisAI!</h1>
  </div>

  <p>Dear {{name}},</p>
  
  <p>Welcome to SyntaxisAI! We're thrilled to have you on board. Your account has been successfully created and is ready to use.</p>
  
  <div class="features">
    <h3>Here's what you can do with SyntaxisAI:</h3>
    <ul>
      <li class="feature-item">Upload and process invoices automatically</li>
      <li class="feature-item">Extract key information with high accuracy</li>
      <li class="feature-item">Manage your invoice data efficiently</li>
      <li class="feature-item">Generate detailed reports and analytics</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <p>To get started, click the button below to log in to your account:</p>
  
  <a href="{{loginLink}}" class="button">Log In to Your Account</a>
  
  <p>If you have any questions or need assistance, our support team is here to help. You can reach us at support@syntaxis.ai or through the help center in your dashboard.</p>
  
  <div class="footer">
    <p>This is an automated message, please do not reply to this email.</p>
    <p>&copy; {{currentYear}} SyntaxisAI. All rights reserved.</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html> 